.TH UOO-BOOT-HELPER 1 "October 2026" "Uoo Boot Manager" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
uoo-boot-helper \- authenticated administrator helper for Uoo
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B uoo-boot-helper --stdin
.SH DESCRIPTION
Internal interface used by the installed Uoo desktop through polkit.
It accepts one bounded JSON request on standard input and prints a JSON
response. The helper validates its protected installation, the caller, the
request, and the detected boot configuration before applying an operation.
.PP
Use the desktop application to review and authenticate changes.
Do not replace the helper with a copy from a user-writable source tree.
The helper does not accept arbitrary shell commands.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/lib/uoo-boot-manager/helper.py
Installed helper implementation.
.TP
.I /usr/share/polkit-1/actions/org.uoo.boot-manager.policy
Authentication policy for the fixed helper command.
.SH AUTHOR
Hayk Jomardyan.
